flowchart LR
  q([複雜問題]) --> reasoning-model[Reasoning Model]
  effort[思考程度設定] --> reasoning-model
  reasoning-model --> think[內部思考<br/>Reasoning Tokens]
  think -- 拆解、嘗試、檢查 --> think
  think --> ans[最終回答]
  think -. 佔用 .-> context-window[(Context Window)]
  chain-of-thought[Chain-of-Thought<br/>靠 prompt 引導] -. 對照 .-> llm[一般 LLM]
